OL,3,GNEWSALeaders welcome Surrey mayor
OL,4,Aupdate in Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FA proposed agreement for Surrey to get
OL,7,Fan elected mayor, set out in the
OL,8,FBudget, has been welcomed by council
OL,9,Fleaders.
OL,11,FThe document setting out the
OL,12,Fgovernment's financial plans, which
OL,13,Faccompanied the Chancellor's speech in
OL,14,FParliament on Wednesday, also set out
OL,15,Fnew details for regional devolution.
OL,17,FThe government is in the "final stages
OL,18,Fof agreeing 10 new devolution
OL,19,Fagreements" with elected mayors,
OL,20,Fincluding one for Surrey, according to
OL,21,Fthe document.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
