OL,3,GNEWSALeaders welcome Surrey mayor
OL,4,Aupdate in Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FSurrey County Council leader Tim Oliver
OL,7,Fwelcomed the "government's intention to
OL,8,Fsecure a mayor for Surrey" and called
OL,9,Ffor East and West Surrey councils -
OL,10,Fwhose leaders also welcomed the
OL,11,Fproposal - to "go full throttle" to
OL,12,Fdeliver it.
